{% set lead = media.featuredVideos[0] %}
<div class="media-feature">
  <a class="video-card video-card-featured" href="{{ lead.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-media-link="youtube-video" aria-label="Watch {{ lead.title }} on YouTube (opens in a new tab)"><div class="video-thumbnail"><img src="{{ lead.image }}" alt="" width="{{ lead.width }}" height="{{ lead.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="video-play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span></div><div class="video-meta"><span>{{ lead.views }}</span><span>{{ lead.topic }}</span></div><h3>{{ lead.title }}</h3></a>
  <div class="media-note"><h3>Will this help the business, or just help us build more?</h3><p>Building has a cost beyond the first version. Someone has to use it, look after it and make sure it solves the problem.</p><p>That’s why I care about the choice before the build. Getting faster at the wrong work isn’t progress.</p><p class="note-signoff">Adrian Ching</p></div>
</div>
<div class="media-supporting">{% for video in media.featuredVideos %}{% if not loop.first %}<a class="video-card" href="{{ video.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-media-link="youtube-video" aria-label="Watch {{ video.title }} on YouTube (opens in a new tab)"><div class="video-thumbnail"><img src="{{ video.image }}" alt="" width="{{ video.width }}" height="{{ video.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="video-play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></span></div><div><div class="video-meta"><span>{{ video.views }}</span><span>{{ video.topic }}</span></div><h3>{{ video.title }}</h3></div></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
